{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","潘多拉"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名手持潘多拉魔盒的辅助，会在战场中散布混乱和灾祸。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","你想为他们送上怎样的礼物？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","What gift shall we bestow?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","你为我带来了新的力量。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","You give me new strength!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","为这个世界带来毁灭吧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Bring ruin to this world."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","招来灾祸者……必将毁灭自身……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Those who destroy will destroy themselves..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","这场胜利，还合你的心意吗？"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Is this victory to your liking?"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","众神的使者，降临于此。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","I am the herald of the gods."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我喜欢珍贵的东西，比如，这些首饰，又比如……这个匣子。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I adore precious things like this jewelry here, and of course, this box."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","想知道里面是什么？……抱歉，现在还不能告诉你。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Would you like to know what's inside? Apologies, I can't tell you just yet."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","造出我的众神曾说过，我是完美的。你怎么想呢？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","The gods claimed perfection when they made me. What's your verdict?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我愿意付出一切来回报这份礼物。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢，很合我的心意。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","想看看盒子里面吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","其他人什么时候会到呢？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","能为我调杯专属饮料吗？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","据说，潘多拉来自一个已经毁灭的世界。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","即使是创造出潘多拉的神明，在她第一次睁开双眼时，也为她的美丽屏息。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","潘多拉随身携带的匣子是神明送给凡人的礼物，据说里面有足以毁灭世界的秘密。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","原则上，潘多拉不会打开匣子。除非有能够让她放弃原则的东西。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","潘多拉最像凡人的地方，或许是她对华贵金饰的偏爱。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说潘多拉身上的装饰品价值连城，许多都是她过去的追求者所赠。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","在打开匣子以前，潘多拉曾真的以为自己的匣子中，装着什么比金子还贵重的礼品。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","当匣子被打开的那一瞬间，数不清的灾厄席卷了潘多拉的家乡，她成了一个招致毁灭的不祥之人。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","在灾厄全部都被释放出来后，潘多拉发现了一道不知通向何处的时空隧道，随后她便穿越隧道来到了伊索米亚。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“我为你留下了一件礼物……希望。这是专门送给你的。”时至今日，潘多拉还是经常想起那位创造自己的神明充满怜悯的寄语。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","没想到这里还有这样的好地方。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415670.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","潘多拉 & 多莉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","想看看盒子里面吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415689.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","潘多拉"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","能为我调杯专属饮料吗？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415690.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","潘多拉"]]}